# link time. Until this pin moved, a bare `./make` on a fresh clone of
# `main` could not link the selfhost compiler at all; every build needed
# `BIT_STAGE0_BIN` plus a two-pass bootstrap to route around the mismatch.
# This pin is what makes a bare `./make` possible again.
